From e0ef7e4a1558fceed7e81d3d35e06c3b269c24d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:27:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Restore Felucca's PHASE, LOFI, VOICE, TRIO and PHYS;
 retire CZ-1 and SID; add CC 20-27

MELODEE_FELUCCA_ENGINES (default 1) puts Felucca's PHASE (2, with FOLD), LOFI (3), VOICE (5),
TRIO (6) and PHYS (9) back at their original engine numbers and retires CZ-1 (15) and SID (3,
LOFI's again). DRUM keeps KIT SID. Track 3 powers on with LOFI PULSE LD. 0 builds the CZ-1/SID
firmware.

Fixed MIDI CCs, independent of MIDI KNOBS: CC 20-23 turn knobs 1-4 (whatever they edit on the
screen shown), CC 24-27 set the LVL of tracks 1-4.

Tests: the suite's fixtures build the CZ-1/SID firmware; the shipping engines get their own
retirement, CC, regression (golden/CPU) and editor-table checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0131vpfZVN4vprBnQkpmn5yn
