       <section id="about">
         <h2>About</h2>
         <p>Melodee is multi-engine synthesizer and sequencer firmware for the M-VAVE FM-1. After you install it, the unit runs Melodee instead of the official firmware: up to eight tracks (four that play an instrument, four more for external MIDI gear), a 64-step sequencer with patterns and songs, effects, USB MIDI and audio, Bluetooth MIDI and USB Host.</p>
-        <p>The selectable engines are <strong>Prophet</strong>, <strong>FM6</strong>, <strong>CZ-1</strong>, <strong>SID</strong> and <strong>Drum</strong>, plus <strong>MIDI Track</strong> for external gear. Melodee is based on <a href="https://github.com/hugelton/Felucca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Felucca</a>; it is not affiliated with or endorsed by M-VAVE or Hügelton Instruments. Report Melodee problems on the <a href="https://github.com/keremimo/melodee" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Melodee GitHub</a>, not to Felucca.</p>
+        <p>The selectable engines are <strong>Prophet</strong>, <strong>FM6</strong>, Felucca’s <strong>Phase</strong>, <strong>LoFi</strong>, <strong>Voice</strong>, <strong>Trio</strong>, <strong>Wheel</strong> and <strong>Phys</strong>, and <strong>Drum</strong>, plus <strong>MIDI Track</strong> for external gear. Melodee is based on <a href="https://github.com/hugelton/Felucca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Felucca</a>; it is not affiliated with or endorsed by M-VAVE or Hügelton Instruments. Report Melodee problems on the <a href="https://github.com/keremimo/melodee" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Melodee GitHub</a>, not to Felucca.</p>
       </section>
 
